OL,3,GNEWSACar that crashed into house was in
OL,4,Apolice chase
OL,5,
OL,6,FA car that smashed into the front room
OL,7,Fof a house and ended up on its roof was
OL,8,Fbeing chased by police before it
OL,9,Fcrashed.
OL,11,FNorth Wales Police said the vehicle had
OL,12,Ffailed to stop for officers, entered a
OL,13,Froad closure, struck a bridge and hit
OL,14,Fthe property in Canal View, Chirk Bank,
OL,15,FShropshire, at 21:54 GMT on Saturday.
OL,17,FWest Midlands Ambulance Service was
OL,18,Fcalled to the scene just after 22:00,
OL,19,Fand said a man who was driving the car
OL,20,Fhad suffered potentially serious
OL,21,Finjuries, and was taken to the Royal
OL,22,FShrewsbury Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
